The map demo in this repository (apps/map-demo), which no npm package
includes, draws geographic data from Natural Earth: the 1:110m land and
lakes at tag v5.1.2 of github.com/nvkelso/natural-earth-vector, rounded to
0.1 degree. Natural Earth's terms of use place that data in the public
domain and ask for no credit; it is credited here as those terms suggest:
Made with Natural Earth. Free vector and raster map data @ naturalearthdata.com.
